WEBVTT

00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:02.478
Current versus future demand.

00:00:02.528 --> 00:00:05.757
Only about fifteen percent of buyers are in market right now.

00:00:05.807 --> 00:00:08.938
The other eighty-five percent are future buyers.

00:00:09.633 --> 00:00:11.116
Don't just talk to the four hands that are up right now.

00:00:11.166 --> 00:00:16.439
That student buying a phone in three years is worth reaching today.

00:00:17.133 --> 00:00:18.805
So Telstra swapped dry,

00:00:18.855 --> 00:00:21.045
rational offers for emotional brand building,

00:00:21.095 --> 00:00:24.203
so people would remember it when their contract ran out.

00:00:24.900 --> 00:00:26.100
Use it like this:

00:00:26.150 --> 00:00:31.218
split your plan into converting today's buyers and building memories for tomorrow's.
